  "value": "# Lab 1: Heartbeat\n\n**Goal:** deploy your first Action and watch it in the Data Viewer.\n\n**You will build:** `Heartbeat`, an Action that publishes `ok` to `campus/weather/heartbeat` every 5 seconds.\n\n**How to run a cell:** click ▷ at the top left of the cell. **Deploy All** (top right) runs every cell of this notebook, top to bottom. Each cell answers *… added successfully*."
